Service context manager to spin up a gRPC server and stub for testing RPC calls']\n```\n\nUsage\n\n```\n{'test_grpc_python_plugin': 'test the gRPC Python protoc plugin by running unittest on all RPC call types including unary, streaming, and duplex', 'run_servicer_methods': 'run the _ServicerMethods class to handle unary, streaming output, streaming input, full duplex, and half duplex RPC calls', 'create_grpc_service': 'create a live gRPC service with _CreateService that provides a servicer backend, server, and stub for testing RPCs', 'test_simple_stubs': 'test the simple stubs API via SimpleStubsPluginTest to invoke unary, streaming, and duplex calls without explicit stub instantiation', 'review_servicer_control': 'review the _ServicerMethods pause and fail context managers that control RPC execution flow for testing timeouts and cancellations'}\n```\n\n## File: facebookresearch_diplomacycicero/thirdparty/github/fairinternal/postman/third_party/grpc/src/python/grpcio_tests/tests/protoc_plugin/_split_definitions_test.py\n\nPrompts\n\n```\n['test the gRPC Python protoc plugin by running unittest on all RPC call types including unary, streaming, and duplex', 'run the _ServicerMethods class to handle unary, streaming output, streaming input, full duplex, and half duplex RPC calls', 'create a live gRPC service with _CreateService that provides a servicer backend, server, and stub for testing RPCs', 'test the simple stubs API via SimpleStubsPluginTest to invoke unary, streaming, and duplex calls without explicit stub instantiation', 'review the _ServicerMethods pause and fail context managers that control RPC execution flow for testing timeouts and cancellations', 'run the gRPC protoc plugin split definitions test suite with unittest', 'create a nested directory tree from a sequence of path component lists', 'substitute package namespaces and import paths in raw proto file content', 'add empty __init__.py files to all subdirectories under a given directory', 'invoke grpc